entries.body:
Verifies graph shape constraints:
- each module contains exactly one unnamed (top-level) crag.graph op,
  plus zero or more named subgraphs;
- each graph uses one block;
- parameter names are unique within each graph;
- each graph has at least one crag.output op;
- crag.subgraph_ref ops reference a named graph that exists in the module,
  with matching sample_rate and channels, the correct number of inputs, and
  matching input audio types.

Switches the name of a FuncOp named `bar` to `foo` and folds.
```
func.func @bar() {
  return
}
// Gets transformed to:
func.func @foo() {
  return
}
```
